  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Wavemaker 5</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Fund will increase access to equity and operational value-added for tech startups in SEA that are developing tech-led innovative solutions to disrupt various real sector business models. These innovative business models can introduce digital solutions, strengthen supply chains, improve price transparency, and have a demonstration effect by catalyzing replication from new entrants. The Fund will also invest in deep tech solutions which can often have transformational and large-scale impacts by enabling disruption across markets and jumpstarting new industries. Further, the Fund may commit for the first time to targeting at least 25% of its investments into female founders, in the context of a region where women-led enterprises received less than 9% of equity.</narrative>
  </description>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Wavemaker Pacific 5, L.P. (Wavemaker SEA Fund V or the Fund) is targeted to be a US$150 million Venture Capital (VC) fund focused on early-stage investments in the Southeast Asia (SEA) region. The Fund aims to invest in enterprise, deep tech and sustainability focused companies primarily in Southeast Asia (SEA).</narrative>
  </description>
